ss=\"inc-state-panel__icon\">!</div>\n <div>\n <h3 class=\"inc-state-panel__title\">Export failed</h3>\n <p class=\"inc-state-panel__body\">Use a proper failure surface, not just a muted paragraph.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-permission-banner\">\n <div class=\"inc-permission-banner__icon\">#</div>\n <div>\n <h3 class=\"inc-permission-banner__title\">Finance Manager role required</h3>\n <p class=\"inc-permission-banner__text\">Show when an action is visible but intentionally unavailable.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-toast-stack\">\n <div class=\"inc-toast-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-toast-card__icon\">i</div>\n <div>\n <h3 class=\"inc-toast-card__title\">View saved</h3>\n <p class=\"inc-toast-card__text\">Use for asynchronous success or background-status messages.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n<pre class=\"demo-code\"><code>&lt;div class=\"inc-state-panel inc-state-panel--results\"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=\"inc-state-panel inc-state-panel--error\"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"inc-permission-banner\"&gt;\n &lt;div class=\"inc-permission-banner__icon\"&gt;#&lt;/div&gt;\n &lt;div&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"inc-toast-stack\"&gt;\n &lt;div class=\"inc-toast-card\"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>\n </div>\n </section>\n\n <section class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h2 class=\"inc-card__title\">Detail, Timeline, Files, And Grid Patterns</h2>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body demo-reference-grid\">\n <div class=\"demo-preview demo-stack\">\n <div class=\"inc-key-value-grid\">\n <dl class=\"inc-key-value inc-key-value--card\">\n <dt class=\"inc-key-value__label\">Record Id</dt>\n <dd class=\"inc-key-value__value inc-key-value__value--data\">AP-2026-00142</dd>\n </dl>\n <dl class=\"inc-key-value inc-key-value--card\">\n <dt class=\"inc-key-value__label\">Current request</dt>\n <dd class=\"inc-key-value__value inc-key-value__value--data\">$18,240.22</dd>\n </dl>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-timeline\">\n <div class=\"inc-timeline__item\">\n <div class=\"inc-timeline__rail\">\n <span class=\"inc-timeline__dot\"></span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-timeline__content\">\n <div class=\"inc-timeline__header\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-timeline__title\">Imported from OpenPay</h3>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-timeline__meta\">\n <span>8:13 AM</span>\n <span>Nightly sync</span>\n </div>\n <p class=\"inc-timeline__body\">Timeline entries combine actor, time, event, and state without falling apart visually.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div id=\"ref-file-workflow-example\" class=\"inc-stack inc-stack--gap-md\" data-inc-file-example>\n <input id=\"ref-file-workflow-input\" class=\"inc-u-visually-hidden\" type=\"file\" multiple data-inc-file-input>\n <div class=\"inc-file-dropzone\" data-inc-file-dropzone aria-describedby=\"ref-file-workflow-list\">\n <div class=\"inc-file-dropzone__content\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-file-dropzone__title\">Drop documents here</h3>\n <p class=\"inc-file-dropzone__text\">For review workflows with waiver or attachment requirements.</p>\n </div>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-file-browse>Browse Files</button>\n </div>\n <div id=\"ref-file-workflow-list\" class=\"inc-file-list\" data-inc-file-list>\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--small inc-text--muted\" data-inc-file-empty>No files selected yet.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-bulk-bar\">\n <div class=\"inc-bulk-bar__meta\">\n <span class=\"inc-bulk-bar__count\">3 rows selected</span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-bulk-bar__actions\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--danger inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\">Reject Selected</button>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n<pre class=\"demo-code\"><code>&lt;div class=\"inc-key-value-grid\"&gt;\n &lt;dl class=\"inc-key-value inc-key-value--card\"&gt;\n &lt;dt class=\"inc-key-value__label\"&gt;Record Id&lt;/dt&gt;\n &lt;dd class=\"inc-key-value__value inc-key-value__value--data\"&gt;AP-2026-00142&lt;/dd&gt;\n &lt;/dl&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"inc-timeline\"&gt;\n &lt;div class=\"inc-timeline__item\"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"inc-file-dropzone\"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=\"inc-bulk-bar\"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>\n </div>\n </section>\n\n <section class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h2 class=\"inc-card__title\">Auto Refresh Widget</h2>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body demo-reference-grid\">\n <div class=\"demo-preview demo-stack\">\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--small inc-text--muted\">Use the inline modifier inside cards or toolbars, and the base class when you want the widget pinned to the page corner.</p>\n <div class=\"inc-auto-refresh inc-auto-refresh--inline\"\n data-inc-auto-refresh\n data-inc-refresh-seconds=\"180\"\n data-inc-refresh-label=\"Queue refresh in\"\n data-inc-refresh-loading-label=\"Refreshing queue\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary inc-btn--micro inc-auto-refresh__toggle\"\n type=\"button\"\n data-inc-action=\"auto-refresh-toggle\"\n aria-label=\"Pause\"\n aria-pressed=\"false\">\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__toggle-text\">Pause</span>\n </button>\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__countdown\">\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__label\">Queue refresh in</span>\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__value\">180s</span>\n </span>\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\" hidden>\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <span class=\"inc-spinner inc-spinner--border inc-spinner--border--sm inc-spinner--border--primary\"></span>\n <span class=\"inc-spinner inc-spinner--grow inc-spinner--grow--sm inc-spinner--grow--primary\"></span>\n </span>\n <span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__status-text\">Refreshing queue</span>\n </span>\n </div>\n </div>\n<pre class=\"demo-code\"><code>&lt;div class=\"inc-auto-refresh\"\n data-inc-auto-refresh\n data-inc-refresh-seconds=\"30\"\n data-inc-refresh-label=\"Refresh in\"\n data-inc-refresh-loading-label=\"Refreshing\"&gt;\n &lt;button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary inc-btn--micro inc-auto-refresh__toggle\"\n type=\"button\"\n data-inc-action=\"auto-refresh-toggle\"\n aria-label=\"Pause\"\n aria-pressed=\"false\"&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__toggle-text\"&gt;Pause&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;/button&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__countdown\"&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__label\"&gt;Refresh in&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__value\"&gt;30s&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\" hidden&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\"&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-spinner inc-spinner--border inc-spinner--border--sm inc-spinner--border--primary\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-spinner inc-spinner--grow inc-spinner--grow--sm inc-spinner--grow--primary\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-auto-refresh__status-text\"&gt;Refreshing&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"inc-auto-refresh inc-auto-refresh--inline\"\n data-inc-auto-refresh\n data-inc-refresh-seconds=\"90\"&gt;\n ...\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>\n </div>\n </section>\n </div>\n </main>\n <footer class=\"inc-app-shell__footer inc-footer-bar\">\n <div class=\"inc-footer-bar__menu\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\" data-demo-copy-first-snippet>Copy snippet</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\">Open docs</button>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-footer-bar__meta\">Reference page for copy/paste HTML patterns. Web Components are the default code view here, while the class catalog remains authoritative.</div>\n </footer>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <dialog id=\"reference-native-dialog\" class=\"inc-native-dialog\">\n <div class=\"inc-native-dialog__surface\">\n <div class=\"inc-native-dialog__header\">\n <div>\n <h2 class=\"inc-native-dialog__title\">Reference Dialog</h2>\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--small inc-text--muted\">Native dialog example for copy/paste use.</p>\n </div>\n <form method=\"dialog\">\n <button class=\"inc-native-dialog__close\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\">×</button>\n </form>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-native-dialog__body\">\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--regular\">This is the minimal dialog shell used on the native page. Copy the outer <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code>, the surface wrapper, and the form-based footer if you want native close behavior.</p>\n </div>\n <form method=\"dialog\" class=\"inc-native-dialog__footer\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary\" type=\"submit\">Close</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"submit\">Confirm</button>\n </form>\n </div>\n </dialog>\n\n <dialog id=\"reference-drawer-dialog\" class=\"inc-native-dialog inc-native-dialog--drawer\">\n <div class=\"inc-native-dialog__surface\">\n <div class=\"inc-native-dialog__header\">\n <div>\n <h2 class=\"inc-native-dialog__title\">Reference Drawer</h2>\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--small inc-text--muted\">Native side sheet example for assignment and note-taking flows.</p>\n </div>\n <form method=\"dialog\">\n <button class=\"inc-native-dialog__close\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Close drawer\">×</button>\n </form>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-native-dialog__body inc-u-stack-md\">\n <div class=\"inc-key-value-grid\">\n <dl class=\"inc-key-value inc-key-value--card\">\n <dt class=\"inc-key-value__label\">Record</dt>\n <dd class=\"inc-key-value__value inc-key-value__value--data\">AP-2026-00142</dd>\n </dl>\n <dl class=\"inc-key-value inc-key-value--card\">\n <dt class=\"inc-key-value__label\">Current owner</dt>\n <dd class=\"inc-key-value__value\">AP Team</dd>\n </dl>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-form__group\">\n <label class=\"inc-form__label\" for=\"reference-drawer-note\">Routing note</label>\n <textarea id=\"reference-drawer-note\" class=\"inc-form__control\" rows=\"4\">Route to Legal Review so the W-9 can be validated before export.</textarea>\n </div>\n </div>\n <form method=\"dialog\" class=\"inc-native-dialog__footer\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary\" type=\"submit\">Cancel</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"submit\">Assign</button>\n </form>\n </div>\n </dialog>\n\n <script src=\"./dist/inc-design-language.js\"></script>\n <script>\n (() => {\n document.querySelectorAll(\"dialog.inc-native-dialog\").forEach((dialog) => {\n dialog.addEventListener(\"click\", (event) => {\n if (event.target === dialog) {\n dialog.close(\"dismiss\");\n }\n });\n });\n })();\n\n (() => {\n const storageKey = \"inc-reference-code-mode\";\n const modeLabels = {\n html: \"HTML + CSS\",\n wc: \"Web Components\",\n };\n const wcSnippets = {\n \"theme-switcher\": `<div class=\"inc-theme-toggle\" data-inc-theme-switcher>\n <div class=\"inc-theme-toggle__label\">\n <p class=\"inc-theme-toggle__title\">Appearance</p>\n <p class=\"inc-theme-toggle__value\" data-inc-theme-label>System</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-button-group inc-button-group--sm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Theme mode\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-theme-mode=\"light\">Light</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-theme-mode=\"dark\">Dark</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-theme-mode=\"system\">System</button>\n </div>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\" data-inc-theme-toggle>Cycle</button>\n</div>\n\n<inc-theme-switcher variant=\"navbar\" block label=\"Theme\" menu-label=\"Theme menu\" heading=\"Choose appearance\"></inc-theme-switcher>`,\n \"page-framing\": `<inc-page wide>\n <div slot=\"breadcrumbs\" class=\"inc-page__breadcrumbs\">\n <ol class=\"inc-breadcrumb\">\n <li class=\"inc-breadcrumb__item\"><a href=\"./index.html\">Examples</a></li>\n <li class=\"inc-breadcrumb__item active\"><span>Reference</span></li>\n </ol>\n </div>\n <inc-page-header slot=\"header\">\n <div slot=\"title\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-heading inc-heading--h3\">Breadcrumb body wrapper</h3>\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--regular inc-text--muted\">Use the canonical page wrapper when you want a breadcrumb strip and body stack without introducing another bespoke shell.</p>\n </div>\n <div slot=\"actions\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\">Secondary action</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\">Primary action</button>\n </div>\n </inc-page-header>\n</inc-page>`,\n \"cards-metrics-and-empty-states\": `<inc-summary-overview columns=\"3\">\n <inc-summary-block>\n <div slot=\"header\">Total Revenue</div>\n <div slot=\"body\"><strong>$247,832</strong></div>\n </inc-summary-block>\n <inc-summary-block>\n <div slot=\"header\">Active Projects</div>\n <div slot=\"body\"><strong>12</strong></div>\n <div slot=\"footer\">In Progress</div>\n </inc-summary-block>\n <inc-summary-block>\n <div slot=\"header\">Exceptions</div>\n <div slot=\"body\"><strong>4</strong></div>\n </inc-summary-block>\n</inc-summary-overview>\n\n<inc-state-panel variant=\"results\" title=\"No saved views\" body=\"Create a named filter set so your operators can reuse it across screens.\" status=\"+\"></inc-state-panel>`,\n \"form-fields\": `<inc-field required label=\"Text input\">\n <label slot=\"label\" class=\"inc-form__label\" for=\"ref-name\">Text input</label>\n <input slot=\"control\" id=\"ref-name\" class=\"inc-form__control\" type=\"text\" value=\"North Campus Expansion\">\n</inc-field>\n\n<inc-input-group dense expand prefix=\"$\">\n <span slot=\"prefix\" class=\"inc-input-group__text\">$</span>\n <input slot=\"control\" class=\"inc-form__control\" type=\"text\" value=\"18240.22\">\n</inc-input-group>\n\n<inc-choice-group legend=\"Approval route\">\n <legend slot=\"legend\">Approval route</legend>\n <div slot=\"item\" class=\"inc-form__check\">\n <input id=\"route-fast\" name=\"route\" type=\"radio\" checked>\n <label for=\"route-fast\">Fast approval</label>\n </div>\n <div slot=\"item\" class=\"inc-form__check\">\n <input id=\"route-standard\" name=\"route\" type=\"radio\">\n <label for=\"route-standard\">Standard approval</label>\n </div>\n</inc-choice-group>\n\n<inc-validation-summary count=\"2\" live=\"polite\">\n <ul>\n <li slot=\"item\"><a href=\"#ref-name\">Project name is required.</a></li>\n <li slot=\"item\"><a href=\"#route-standard\">Approval owner missing.</a></li>\n </ul>\n</inc-validation-summary>\n\n<inc-readonly-field label=\"Record ID\" value=\"AP-2026-00142\">\n <span slot=\"meta\">Synced 8:13 AM</span>\n</inc-readonly-field>`,\n tabs: `<inc-tabs selected=\"ref-folder-overview\" variant=\"folder\">\n <button slot=\"tab\" id=\"ref-folder-overview\" type=\"button\" class=\"inc-tab\">Overview</button>\n <button slot=\"tab\" id=\"ref-folder-aging\" type=\"button\" class=\"inc-tab\">Aging</button>\n <section slot=\"panel\" class=\"inc-tab-pane\">Folder tab content.</section>\n <section slot=\"panel\" class=\"inc-tab-pane\">Second folder tab content.</section>\n</inc-tabs>`,\n \"native-controls\": `<inc-disclosure open>\n <span slot=\"summary\" class=\"demo-disclosure-title\">\n <span class=\"inc-disclosure__title\">Billing summary</span>\n <span class=\"inc-badge inc-badge--info inc-badge--pill\">3 items</span>\n </span>\n <div slot=\"content\">\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--regular\">Example disclosure body.</p>\n </div>\n</inc-disclosure>\n\n<inc-user-menu label=\"Queue Actions\" variant=\"block\">\n <span slot=\"trigger\" class=\"inc-user-menu__avatar\">AP</span>\n <div slot=\"menu\" role=\"menu\">\n <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\">Export current view</button>\n <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\">Save filter preset</button>\n </div>\n</inc-user-menu>\n\n<inc-dialog id=\"reference-dialog\" label=\"Reference Dialog\" modal dismissible size=\"lg\">\n <div slot=\"title\">Reference Dialog</div>\n <div slot=\"body\">Native dialog example for copy/paste use.</div>\n <div slot=\"footer\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-dialog-close>Close</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"button\">Confirm</button>\n </div>\n</inc-dialog>\n\n<inc-drawer id=\"reference-drawer\" label=\"Reference Drawer\" placement=\"end\" dismissible>\n <div slot=\"title\">Reference Drawer</div>\n <div slot=\"body\">Native side sheet example for assignment and note-taking flows.</div>\n <div slot=\"footer\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-dialog-close>Cancel</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"button\">Assign</button>\n </div>\n</inc-drawer>`,\n \"validation-and-filter-toolbars\": `<inc-validation-summary count=\"2\" live=\"assertive\">\n <ul>\n <li slot=\"item\"><a href=\"#ref-contract\">Contract number is required.</a></li>\n <li slot=\"item\"><a href=\"#ref-filter-search\">Billing period must be selected.</a></li>\n </ul>\n</inc-validation-summary>\n\n<inc-field label=\"Contract number\" required invalid>\n <label slot=\"label\" class=\"inc-form__label inc-form__label--required\" for=\"ref-contract\">Contract number</label>\n <input slot=\"control\" id=\"ref-contract\" class=\"inc-form__control is-invalid\" type=\"text\" aria-invalid=\"true\">\n <p slot=\"error\" class=\"inc-form__feedback inc-form__feedback--error\">Contract number is required.</p>\n</inc-field>\n\n<inc-field label=\"Search\">\n <label slot=\"label\" class=\"inc-form__label\" for=\"ref-filter-search\">Search</label>\n <input slot=\"control\" id=\"ref-filter-search\" class=\"inc-form__control inc-form__control--sm\" type=\"text\" value=\"North Campus\">\n</inc-field>\n\n<inc-readonly-field label=\"Owner\" value=\"AP Team\"></inc-readonly-field>`,\n \"operational-states-and-feedback\": `<inc-state-panel variant=\"results\" title=\"No results matched\" body=\"Distinct from the create-first empty state.\" status=\"?\"></inc-state-panel>\n\n<inc-state-panel variant=\"error\" title=\"Export failed\" body=\"Use a proper failure surface, not just a muted paragraph.\" status=\"!\"></inc-state-panel>\n\n<inc-live-region politeness=\"polite\" atomic=\"true\">View saved</inc-live-region>`,\n \"overlay-workflows\": `<inc-dialog id=\"approval-dialog\" label=\"Approve exception\" modal dismissible size=\"lg\">\n <div slot=\"title\">Approve exception</div>\n <div slot=\"body\">Include the validation summary and rationale field here.</div>\n <div slot=\"footer\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-dialog-close>Cancel</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-initial-focus>Approve exception</button>\n </div>\n</inc-dialog>\n\n<inc-drawer id=\"assignment-drawer\" label=\"Assignment drawer\" placement=\"end\" dismissible>\n <div slot=\"title\">Assign review owner</div>\n <div slot=\"body\">\n <inc-field label=\"Owner\" required>\n <label slot=\"label\" class=\"inc-form__label\" for=\"drawer-owner\">Owner</label>\n <select slot=\"control\" id=\"drawer-owner\">\n <option selected>AP Team</option>\n <option>Legal Review</option>\n <option>Compliance</option>\n </select>\n </inc-field>\n </div>\n <div slot=\"footer\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-dialog-close>Cancel</button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" type=\"button\" data-inc-initial-focus>Assign owner</button>\n </div>\n</inc-drawer>`,\n \"auto-refresh-widget\": `<inc-auto-refresh seconds=\"180\" label=\"Queue refresh in\" loading-label=\"Refreshing queue\"></inc-auto-refresh>`,\n };\n\n const normalizeKey = (value) => String(value || \"\")\n .toLowerCase()\n .replace(/&/g, \"and\")\n .replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, \"-\")\n .replace(/^-+|-+$/g, \"\");\n\n const readStoredMode = () => {\n try {\n const storedMode = window.localStorage.getItem(storageKey);\n if (storedMode === \"html\" || storedMode === \"wc\") {\n return storedMode;\n }\n } catch {\n // Ignore storage restrictions in locked-down contexts.\n }\n\n return \"wc\";\n };\n\n const setStorageMode = (mode) => {\n try {\n if (mode === \"wc\") {\n window.localStorage.removeItem(storageKey);\n } else {\n window.localStorage.setItem(storageKey, mode);\n }\n } catch {\n // Ignore storage restrictions in locked-down contexts.\n }\n };\n\n const copyToClipboard = async (text, button) => {\n if (!text) {\n return;\n }\n\n try {\n await window.navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n } catch {\n window.prompt(\"Copy snippet:\", text);\n }\n\n if (!button) {\n return;\n }\n\n const originalLabel = button.getAttribute(\"data-demo-copy-label\") || button.textContent || \"Copy\";\n button.setAttribute(\"data-copied\", \"true\");\n button.textContent = \"Copied\";\n window.setTimeout(() => {\n button.removeAttribute(\"data-copied\");\n button.textContent = originalLabel;\n }, 1200);\n };\n\n const renderLineNumbers = (text) => {\n const lines = text.split(\"\\n\");\n return lines.map((_, index) => String(index + 1)).join(\"\\n\");\n };\n\n const modeButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-demo-code-mode]\"));\n const footerCopyButton = document.querySelector(\"[data-demo-copy-first-snippet]\");\n const viewers = [];\n let currentMode = readStoredMode();\n\n const syncModeButtons = () => {\n modeButtons.forEach((button) => {\n const isActive = button.getAttribute(\"data-demo-code-mode\") === currentMode;\n button.classList.toggle(\"active\", isActive);\n button.setAttribute(\"aria-selected\", isActive ? \"true\" : \"false\");\n button.tabIndex = isActive ? 0 : -1;\n });\n };\n\n const renderViewer = (viewer) => {\n const code = currentMode === \"wc\" && viewer.wcSnippet ? viewer.wcSnippet : viewer.htmlSnippet;\n const note = currentMode === \"wc\" && !viewer.wcSnippet ? \"CSS-first in v1\" : \"\";\n\n viewer.currentCode = code;\n viewer.variantLabel.textContent = modeLabels[currentMode];\n viewer.code.textContent = code;\n viewer.gutter.textContent = renderLineNumbers(code);\n viewer.note.hidden = !note;\n viewer.note.textContent = note;\n viewer.copyButton.setAttribute(\"data-demo-copy-label\", \"Copy\");\n viewer.copyButton.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", \"Copy code snippet\");\n viewer.copyButton.textContent = \"Copy\";\n viewer.copyButton.disabled = !code;\n };\n\n const renderAllViewers = () => {\n syncModeButtons();\n viewers.forEach(renderViewer);\n if (footerCopyButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {\n footerCopyButton.disabled = viewers.length === 0;\n }\n };\n\n const setMode = (mode) => {\n if (mode !== \"html\" && mode !== \"wc\") {\n return;\n }\n\n currentMode = mode;\n setStorageMode(mode);\n renderAllViewers();\n };\n\n modeButtons.forEach((button) => {\n button.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n setMode(button.getAttribute(\"data-demo-code-mode\") || \"wc\");\n });\n });\n\n document.querySelectorAll(\"pre.demo-code\").forEach((pre) => {\n const codeElement = pre.querySelector(\"code\");\n const htmlSnippet = codeElement ? codeElement.textContent.replace(/\\r\\n/g, \"\\n\").trimEnd() : \"\";\n const title = pre.closest(\".inc-card\")?.querySelector(\".inc-card__title\")?.textContent?.trim() || \"Snippet\";\n const key = normalizeKey(title);\n const wcSnippet = wcSnippets[key] || \"\";\n\n const viewer = document.createElement(\"details\");\n viewer.className = \"demo-code demo-code-viewer\";\n viewer.dataset.demoCodeViewer = \"\";\n viewer.dataset.demoCodeKey = key;\n viewer.innerHTML = `\n <summary class=\"demo-code-viewer__header\">\n <span class=\"demo-code-viewer__summary-copy\">\n <span class=\"demo-code-viewer__variant\"></span>\n <span class=\"demo-code-viewer__summary-text\"></span>\n <span class=\"demo-code-viewer__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n </span>\n <button class=\"demo-code-viewer__copy\" type=\"button\"></button>\n </summary>\n <div class=\"demo-code-viewer__body\">\n <pre class=\"demo-code-viewer__gutter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></pre>\n <pre class=\"demo-code-viewer__source\"><code></code></pre>\n </div>\n <p class=\"demo-code-viewer__note\" hidden></p>\n `;\n\n const variantLabel = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__variant\");\n const summaryText = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__summary-text\");\n const chevron = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__chevron\");\n const copyButton = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__copy\");\n const gutter = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__gutter\");\n const code = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__source code\");\n const note = viewer.querySelector(\".demo-code-viewer__note\");\n\n const entry = {\n htmlSnippet,\n wcSnippet,\n currentCode: htmlSnippet,\n variantLabel,\n copyButton,\n gutter,\n code,\n note,\n summaryText,\n chevron,\n };\n\n copyButton.addEventListener(\"click\", (event) => {\n event.preventDefault();\n event.stopPropagation();\n copyToClipboard(entry.currentCode, copyButton);\n });\n\n const updateDisclosureState = () => {\n const isOpen = viewer.open;\n entry.summaryText.textContent = isOpen ? \"Hide code\" : \"Show code\";\n entry.chevron.setAttribute(\"data-open\", isOpen ? \"true\" : \"false\");\n };\n\n viewer.addEventListener(\"toggle\", () => {\n updateDisclosureState();\n });\n\n updateDisclosureState();\n viewers.push(entry);\n pre.replaceWith(viewer);\n });\n\n if (footerCopyButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {\n footerCopyButton.setAttribute(\"data-demo-copy-label\", \"Copy snippet\");\n footerCopyButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n const firstViewer = viewers[0];\n if (!firstViewer) {\n return;\n }\n\n copyToClipboard(firstViewer.currentCode, footerCopyButton);\n });\n }\n\n renderAllViewers();\n })();\n </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
