nc-text inc-text--small\">Common helpers now include stack spacing, gap, padding, hidden/mobile-hidden/desktop-hidden, and visually hidden text.</p>\n </div>\n<pre class=\"demo-code\"><code>&lt;div class=\"inc-u-stack-sm\"&gt;\n &lt;span class=\"inc-badge inc-badge--info inc-badge--pill\"&gt;inc-u-stack-sm&lt;/span&gt;\n &lt;p class=\"inc-text inc-text--regular\"&gt;Light spacing without Bootstrap utilities.&lt;/p&gt;\n &lt;div class=\"demo-chip-row inc-u-gap-sm\"&gt;\n &lt;button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\"&gt;Secondary&lt;/button&gt;\n &lt;button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary inc-btn--sm\" type=\"button\"&gt;Primary&lt;/button&gt;\n &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"inc-alert inc-alert--info inc-u-hidden-mobile\"&gt;Hidden on smaller screens.&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>\n </div>\n </section>\n\n <section class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h2 class=\"inc-card__title\">Table Families</h2>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body demo-reference-grid\">\n <div class=\"demo-preview inc-u-stack-md\">\n <div class=\"demo-layout-grid demo-layout-grid--3\">\n <article class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-card__title\">Review Grid</h3>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body inc-u-p-0\">\n <div class=\"inc-table-responsive\">\n <table class=\"inc-table inc-table--review-grid inc-table--sm\">\n <thead>\n <tr>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">Record</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">State</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header inc-table__header--right\">Amount</th>\n </tr>\n </thead>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--data\">AP-142</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell\">Needs Review</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--numeric\">$18,240</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--data\">AP-148</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell\">Expiring Docs</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--numeric\">