 <dd class=\"inc-key-value__value inc-key-value__value--data\">$18,240.22</dd>\n </dl>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"inc-alert inc-alert--warning\">Missing W-9 verification. Approval routing is blocked until this is resolved.</div>\n\n <div class=\"inc-form__group\">\n <label class=\"inc-form__label\" for=\"drawer-note\">Operator note</label>\n <textarea id=\"drawer-note\" class=\"inc-form__control\" rows=\"4\">Vendor profile needs an updated W-9 before export.</textarea>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"inc-toast-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-toast-card__icon\">i</div>\n <div>\n <h3 class=\"inc-toast-card__title\">Helpful drawer pattern</h3>\n <p class=\"inc-toast-card__text\">This same surface works for assignment, quick edit, exception review, or preview actions.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-drawer__footer\">\n <a class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary\" href=\"#\">Assign Owner</a>\n <a class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary\" href=\"#\">Request Document</a>\n <a class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary\" href=\"#\">Approve</a>\n </div>\n </aside>\n </section>\n\n <section class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <div>\n <h2 class=\"inc-card__title\">Grid families</h2>\n <p class=\"inc-text inc-text--small inc-text--muted\">The table surface now has explicit review, analytics, and spreadsheet variants so the grid can evolve without every page inventing its own table rules.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body\">\n <div class=\"demo-layout-grid demo-layout-grid--3\">\n <article class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-card__title\">Review</h3>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body inc-u-p-0\">\n <div class=\"inc-table-responsive\">\n <table class=\"inc-table inc-table--review-grid inc-table--sm\">\n <thead>\n <tr>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">Record</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">State</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header inc-table__header--right\">Amount</th>\n </tr>\n </thead>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--data\">AP-142</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell\">Needs Review</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--numeric\">$18,240</td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n </article>\n <article class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-card__title\">Analytics</h3>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body inc-u-p-0\">\n <div class=\"inc-table-responsive\">\n <table class=\"inc-table inc-table--analytics-grid inc-table--sm\">\n <thead>\n <tr>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">Week</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header inc-table__header--right\">Approved</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header inc-table__header--right\">Variance</th>\n </tr>\n </thead>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell\">W11</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--numeric\">447</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--numeric\">+4.4%</td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n </article>\n <article class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h3 class=\"inc-card__title\">Spreadsheet</h3>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body inc-u-p-0\">\n <div class=\"inc-table-responsive\">\n <table class=\"inc-table inc-table--spreadsheet-grid inc-table--sm\">\n <thead>\n <tr>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">Line</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header\">Code</th>\n <th class=\"inc-table__header inc-table__header--right\">Hours</th>\n </tr>\n </thead>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell\">001</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell\">FRM-043</td>\n <td class=\"inc-table__cell inc-table__cell--numeric\">8.25</td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n </article>\n </div>\n </div>\n </section>\n\n <section class=\"inc-card\">\n <div class=\"inc-card__header\">\n <h2 class=\"inc-card__title\">Busy Actions</h2>\n </div>\n <div class=\"inc-card__body\">\n <div class=\"demo-chip-row\">\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--primary is-loading\" type=\"button\">Publishing<span class=\"inc-spinner inc-spinner--border inc-spinner--border--sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--secondary is-loading\" type=\"button\">Refreshing<span class=\"inc-spinner inc-spinner--border inc-spinner--border--sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n <button class=\"inc-btn inc-btn--outline-secondary\" type=\"button\">Idle Button</button>\n </div>\n </div>\n </section>\n </div>\n </main>\n <footer class=\"inc-app-shell__footer inc-footer-bar\">\n <div class=\"inc-footer-bar__meta\">Advanced grid workflows for operators and reviewers.</div>\n </footer>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <script src=\"./dist/inc-design-language.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\ndata-grid-advanced.html\ndata-grid-advanced-html\ndata-grid-advanced.html"
