      "searchText": "specs/architecture/_index.md\nRaw curated file content for specs/architecture/_index.md.\n# UI Kit Architecture Index\n\nThis folder contains the design-rationale layer for the Incursa UI kit.\n\n- [`ARC-UIK-0001`](ui-kit/ARC-UIK-0001.md) - design language, token layering, public CSS surface, helper boundaries, native-primitives strategy, example-page roles, and packaging intent\n- [`ARC-UIK-0002`](ui-kit/ARC-UIK-0002.md) - optional Web Component layer architecture, base component model, Shadow DOM policy, registry strategy, helper reuse, and layered package entrypoints\n\n_index.md\nspecs-architecture-index-md\nspecs/architecture/_index.md"
