0003\n - REQ-UIK-LIST-0004\n - REQ-UIK-LIST-0005\n - REQ-UIK-MET-0001\n - REQ-UIK-MET-0002\n - REQ-UIK-MET-0003\n - REQ-UIK-MET-0004\n - REQ-UIK-MET-0005\n - REQ-UIK-MET-0006\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0001\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0002\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0003\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0004\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0005\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0006\n - REQ-UIK-NAV-0007\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0001\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0002\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0003\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0004\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0005\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0006\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0007\n - REQ-UIK-OVL-0008\n - REQ-UIK-RO-0001\n - REQ-UIK-RO-0002\n - REQ-UIK-RO-0003\n - REQ-UIK-SEL-0001\n - REQ-UIK-SEL-0002\n - REQ-UIK-SEL-0003\n - REQ-UIK-SEL-0004\n - REQ-UIK-STD-0001\n - REQ-UIK-STD-0002\n - REQ-UIK-STD-0003\n - REQ-UIK-STD-0004\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0001\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0002\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0003\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0004\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0005\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0006\n - REQ-UIK-TBL-0007\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0001\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0002\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0003\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0004\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0005\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0006\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0007\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0008\n - REQ-UIK-TOK-0009\n - REQ-UIK-TXT-0001\n - REQ-UIK-TXT-0002\n - REQ-UIK-TXT-0003\n - REQ-UIK-TXT-0004\n - REQ-UIK-TXT-0005\n - REQ-UIK-UTL-0001\n - REQ-UIK-UTL-0002\n - REQ-UIK-UTL-0003\n - REQ-UIK-UTL-0004\n - REQ-UIK-UTL-0005\n - REQ-UIK-VAL-0001\n - REQ-UIK-VAL-0002\n - REQ-UIK-VAL-0003\n - REQ-UIK-VAL-0004\n - REQ-UIK-VAL-0005\n - REQ-UIK-VAL-0006\ntags:\n - ui-kit\n - verification\n - source-review\n---\n\n# VER-UIK-0001 - UI Kit Shared Surface Baseline Review\n\n## Purpose\n\nRecord the baseline source-review verification for the revised UI kit public surface, shared foundations, and component conformance rules.\n\n## Scope\n\nThis verification covers the public surface naming baseline, the shared token, accessibility, and control-convention foundations, the public text helpers, the form shell split, the public utility classes, the navigation and page-layout surfaces, the content-family surfaces, the native-first overlay surfaces, and the optional JavaScript helper contract that are currently shipped in the repository.\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- The repository contains the shipped source styles in [`src/inc-design-language.scss`](../../../reference.html) and the compiled CSS in [`dist/inc-design-language.css`](../../../reference.html).\n- The repository contains the shipped helper in [`src/inc-design-language.js`](../../../reference.html).\n- The repository contains example pages that exercise the public classes and helper wiring.\n\n## Verification Method\n\nStatic source review against the shipped SCSS, compiled CSS, JS helper, and example HTML pages. No runtime browser automation or screenshot comparison was performed in this pass.\n\n## Requirements Verified\n\n- Shared foundations: [`REQ-UIK-STD-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-STD.md#req-uik-std-0001-use-stable-public-naming) through [`REQ-UIK-STD-0003`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-STD.md#req-uik-std-0003-reserve-the-utility-prefix), [`REQ-UIK-TOK-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-TOK.md#req-uik-tok-0001-keep-the-theme-facing-token-file-canonical-for-brand-facing-values) through [`REQ-UIK-TOK-0008`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-TOK.md#req-uik-tok-0008-expose-the-shared-control-density-token-family), [`REQ-UIK-A11Y-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-A11Y.md#req-uik-a11y-0001-keep-interactive-surfaces-keyboard-operable-and-visibly-focused) through [`REQ-UIK-A11Y-0006`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-A11Y.md#req-uik-a11y-0006-keep-disabled-controls-perceivable-and-noninteractive), and [`REQ-UIK-CNV-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-CNV.md#req-uik-cnv-0001-keep-control-surfaces-layered) through [`REQ-UIK-CNV-0006`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-CNV.md#req-uik-cnv-0006-allow-mixed-public-surfaces).\n- Typography and action surfaces: [`REQ-UIK-TXT-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-TXT.md#req-uik-txt-0001-provide-public-body-text-helpers) through [`REQ-UIK-TXT-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-TXT.md#req-uik-txt-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-typography-token-and-accessibility-rules), and [`REQ-UIK-BTN-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-BTN.md#req-uik-btn-0001-provide-a-base-button-primitive) through [`REQ-UIK-BTN-0011`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-BTN.md#req-uik-btn-0011-prefer-semantic-native-elements-by-action-intent).\n- Form shell, editable controls, select controls, input groups, and read-only surfaces: [`REQ-UIK-FRM-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FRM.md#req-uik-frm-0001-provide-dense-form-layout-variants) through [`REQ-UIK-FRM-0007`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FRM.md#req-uik-frm-0007-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), [`REQ-UIK-INP-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-INP.md#req-uik-inp-0001-provide-the-base-editable-control-surface) through [`REQ-UIK-INP-0007`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-INP.md#req-uik-inp-0007-comply-with-shared-foundation-rules), [`REQ-UIK-SEL-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-SEL.md#req-uik-sel-0001-provide-select-control-surfaces) through [`REQ-UIK-SEL-0004`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-SEL.md#req-uik-sel-0004-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), [`REQ-UIK-GRP-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-GRP.md#req-uik-grp-0001-provide-input-group-composition) through [`REQ-UIK-GRP-0004`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-GRP.md#req-uik-grp-0004-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), and [`REQ-UIK-RO-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-RO.md#req-uik-ro-0001-provide-a-read-only-field-surface) through [`REQ-UIK-RO-0003`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-RO.md#req-uik-ro-0003-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules).\n- Binary choice and validation: [`REQ-UIK-CHO-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-CHO.md#req-uik-cho-0001-provide-checkbox-choice-wrappers) through [`REQ-UIK-CHO-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-CHO.md#req-uik-cho-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), and [`REQ-UIK-VAL-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-VAL.md#req-uik-val-0001-provide-an-error-summary-surface) through [`REQ-UIK-VAL-0006`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-VAL.md#req-uik-val-0006-comply-with-shared-naming-and-accessibility-rules).\n- Toolbar, content, and utility surfaces: [`REQ-UIK-FLT-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FLT.md#req-uik-flt-0001-provide-a-filter-bar-surface) through [`REQ-UIK-FLT-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FLT.md#req-uik-flt-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-and-accessibility-rules), [`REQ-UIK-CARD-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-CARD.md#req-uik-card-0001-provide-a-neutral-card-container) through [`REQ-UIK-CARD-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-CARD.md#req-uik-card-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), [`REQ-UIK-LIST-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-LIST.md#req-uik-list-0001-provide-a-stacked-list-group-surface) through [`REQ-UIK-LIST-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-LIST.md#req-uik-list-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-and-accessibility-rules), [`REQ-UIK-TBL-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-TBL.md#req-uik-tbl-0001-provide-a-base-table-primitive) through [`REQ-UIK-TBL-0007`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-TBL.md#req-uik-tbl-0007-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), and [`REQ-UIK-UTL-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-UTL.md#req-uik-utl-0001-provide-public-spacing-utilities) through [`REQ-UIK-UTL-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-UTL.md#req-uik-utl-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-rules).\n- Navigation and page layout surfaces: [`REQ-UIK-NAV-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-NAV.md#req-uik-nav-0001-provide-a-navbar-shell) through [`REQ-UIK-NAV-0007`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-NAV.md#req-uik-nav-0007-comply-with-shared-layout-naming-accessibility-and-interaction-rules), and [`REQ-UIK-LAY-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-LAY.md#req-uik-lay-0001-provide-an-application-shell) through [`REQ-UIK-LAY-0004`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-LAY.md#req-uik-lay-0004-preserve-compact-page-framing-at-narrow-widths).\n- Feedback, overlay, metrics, and file surfaces: [`REQ-UIK-FDBK-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FDBK.md#req-uik-fdbk-0001-provide-alert-and-banner-surfaces) through [`REQ-UIK-FDBK-0008`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FDBK.md#req-uik-fdbk-0008-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), [`REQ-UIK-OVL-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-OVL.md#req-uik-ovl-0001-provide-native-disclosure-and-menu-surfaces) through [`REQ-UIK-OVL-0008`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-OVL.md#req-uik-ovl-0008-comply-with-shared-naming-accessibility-and-interaction-rules), [`REQ-UIK-MET-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-MET.md#req-uik-met-0001-provide-summary-metric-surfaces) through [`REQ-UIK-MET-0006`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-MET.md#req-uik-met-0006-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules), and [`REQ-UIK-FILE-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FILE.md#req-uik-file-0001-provide-a-file-intake-surface) through [`REQ-UIK-FILE-0005`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-FILE.md#req-uik-file-0005-comply-with-shared-naming-token-and-accessibility-rules).\n- Interaction surfaces: [`REQ-UIK-INT-0001`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-INT.md#req-uik-int-0001-recognize-helper-managed-toggle-triggers) through [`REQ-UIK-INT-0009`](../../requirements/ui-kit/SPEC-UIK-INT.md#req-uik-int-0009-support-native-dialog-open-hooks).\n\n## Evidence\n\n- The SCSS source and compiled CSS export the public [`inc-*`](../../../reference.html) class surface covered by the revised specs, including the naming baseline, the shared token layer, the control-convention layer, the navigation shell, and the page layout split.\n- The example pages exercise the same classes in the shipped markup patterns, including checkbox, radio, and switch choice controls with the flat check element names plus both button and anchor button surfaces.\n- The JS helper exposes the documented [`data-inc-toggle`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-dismiss`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-backdrop-for`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-auto-refresh`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-refresh-seconds`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-refresh-label`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-refresh-loading-label`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-refresh-paused-label`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-refresh-pause-action-label`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), [`data-inc-refresh-resume-action-label`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js), and [`data-inc-native-dialog-open`](../../../src/inc-design-language.js) behaviors for menus, tabs, collapse, modal, offcanvas, dropdown menus, native dialog launch, and auto-refresh.\n\n## Status\n\nComplete for the current source-review baseline. This does not replace automated browser or visual verification if the project later decides to add it.\n\n## Related Artifacts\n\n- [`specs/requirements/ui-kit/_index.md`](../../requirements/ui-kit/_index.md)\n- [`specs/requirements/ui-kit/REQUIREMENT-GAPS.md`](../../requirements/ui-kit/REQUIREMENT-GAPS.md)\n- [`README.md`](../../../README.md)\n- [`LLMS.txt`](../../../LLMS.txt)",
